{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124200030872-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124215242\"/><p>今晚(24日)第124期六合彩攪珠結果：1、20、26、28、35、41，特別號碼為36。頭獎無人中；二獎6注中，每注派彩1,140,540港元；三獎190注中，每注派彩96,040港元。</p><p>提提大家，嚟緊周四(11月26日)不會舉行攪珠，下期六合彩攪珠將於周六(11月28日)舉行，估計頭獎基金可達102,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:04:05.966813+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:20.645528+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T13:57:19.362001+00:00","content_hash":"ba749671c4c919c8156658107229df2580819462c3fd5e90225a6d6ed905d5e1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:04:05.966813+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}